# 🔐 Selenium Login Automation Project

## 📌 Project Overview
This project automates the login functionality of a web application using Selenium WebDriver with Python. It demonstrates basic automation testing concepts including element identification, synchronization, and validation.

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used
- Python
- Selenium WebDriver
- VS Code
- Git & GitHub

---

## 🚀 Features Implemented
- Automated login functionality using Selenium WebDriver with Python
- Interacted with web elements like username, password fields, and login button
- Used locator strategies such as ID, XPath, and CSS Selectors
- Handled synchronization issues using implicit and explicit waits
- Validated login success using page verification

